@Api = http://localhost:5180

### Checkout with a card that works
POST {{Api}}/api/orders/1001/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{ "cardToken": "tok_visa" }

### Checkout with a card the provider declines
POST {{Api}}/api/orders/1001/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{ "cardToken": "tok_card_declined" }

### Same order, a different card while the first payment is still open
POST {{Api}}/api/orders/1001/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{ "cardToken": "tok_mastercard" }

### Order status and its payment attempts (after a 202 Accepted)
GET {{Api}}/api/orders/1001

### Institutional customer subscribes to order.shipped (the secret is shown only here)
POST {{Api}}/admin/webhooks/subscriptions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "institutionId": "school-0042", "url": "http://localhost:9095/webhooks/bookstore", "eventTypes": ["order.shipped"] }

### Pay and ship the institutional order 1003
POST {{Api}}/api/orders/1003/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{ "cardToken": "tok_visa" }

###
POST {{Api}}/api/orders/1003/ship
Content-Type: application/json

{ "trackingNumber": "LC-7781240" }

### Delivery log
GET {{Api}}/admin/webhooks/messages
